{"doc_id": "doc2961", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the narrative about Balaam, God dispatches an Angel of the Lord to block his journey. The donkey that Balaam is riding perceives the angel and attempts to avoid it, but Balaam, unaware of the celestial presence, beats the animal for refusing to go forward. At that point God miraculously grants the donkey the ability to speak, and it rebukes Balaam for his harsh treatment (Numbers 22:28). Only then does Balaam see the Angel, who tells him that the donkey’s warning prevented his death, and Balaam is instructed to continue his mission.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1410560112, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "In the narrative of Balaam, God sends an angel to block his path, a being that only the donkey Balaam rides can see. When the animal repeatedly refuses to move forward, Balaam beats it, and then, as a divine sign, the donkey is suddenly granted speech. Numbers 22:28 records that the donkey was miraculously given the power to speak and complained to Balaam about the way he was being treated. This moment allows Balaam to perceive the angel, who explains that the donkey’s intervention saved his life, after which Balaam repents and continues his journey under God’s direction.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1633686052, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "cb6ef3a955a0d74096aac552a3c7507f293058139597cad05763d7e50d351016", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Numbers 22:28", "matched_aliases": ["Numbers 22:28"], "query_id": "test90", "question_hash": "1911bfaae8abf9c5c5bb55b881d1ca74beeadd529e5fd0dc44b782b130c52361", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "6280d15dc570749ab82ecfa8e5d39e4e5d4fbe21c8be9ab9c9c1d124bfa9b96f", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 810915052, "similarity": 0.04878048780487805, "source_content_hash": "113bcd32773704d2703b940043dbdaede343b478373305fa4516ca79b56561e8", "source_hash": "a5ded3a20889638f3a173b5682da51fda92cdfd039bff4b933ea56bc387e9b94", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "d52a2fa465d32d745f60afadb9e8624cbffe63d011581146d1533d829ed7fd20", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
