{"doc_id": "doc8105", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In 1885, Hermann Ebbinghaus gathered experimental data and produced one of the earliest graphical representations of how memory declines over time, creating what is now referred to as the forgetting curve.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 129434402, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "8cb2292def32b040eb30ae2e32afa3193315db9224d8ea86da0a3fdd7b979382", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Hermann Ebbinghaus", "matched_aliases": ["Hermann Ebbinghaus"], "query_id": "test224", "question_hash": "976d68e54f9bd0dbe344a1c33cb907c438df5a812ab2376137d39a35fd250b5a", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "43d01b612cf7d31935210bfe0fec503fbe31f8477b035ec2616b4c677256447c", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 653115535, "similarity": 0.5296167247386759, "source_content_hash": "7fcc91d1073ceb184fd853ee7c2ae28efc6ebe49ae7656e2e22de462b1e510eb", "source_hash": "5803bbc3306666cc3038f5e403c7a7f9c9887d82aee8f3ae7e4ba9dd172a5a1d", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "d96c49041b4d7b4cd4737198b236da3dc89003dab13b8cc5a29b3b1d3bec0865", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc8149", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the film, when Walter accepts his true nature as a Muppet, the telethon’s final segment features a short whistling solo. That whistling was performed by musician Andrew Bird, and the credit for the performance is given to Andrew Bird.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1238244603, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "In the movie’s climactic telethon sequence, the solo whistling that closes the show is supplied by musician Andrew Bird. This brief musical moment follows Walter’s realization about his true nature and serves as his final contribution before joining the Muppet troupe.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1206775293, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "f1de0e01bc973523092e201d4a41bc44ac4c0607f27258b001693118052e0552", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Andrew Bird", "matched_aliases": ["Andrew Bird", "musician Andrew Bird"], "query_id": "test227", "question_hash": "4cb312a83a39f25484e2e65725f8a1ab26f92feb26faf6c97145e1abe2552bcf", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "b5bd94ade4ee2beb7a9842427dad159b7362797e8f4ba3383b71582474f42f2f", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 350704943, "similarity": 0.03802938634399308, "source_content_hash": "e619925f2e20d7e5c253eebf87e82d5c84c957a3b298c58e194038819b37df70", "source_hash": "6dc67fc6f477e666f743fe905baf936277396426172309bfc6aa815455a90bb1", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "874782bbca458191ff4c1192be41860860039e477f7eae76d8ffdcbb6850a541", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "que