{"doc_id": "doc12091", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 1986 stage production The Phantom of the Opera features a score composed by Andrew Lloyd Webber; the accompanying lyrics were provided by Charles Hart and Richard Stilgoe, and Lloyd Webber and Stilgoe jointly authored the musical’s book.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1549464397, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "The 1986 stage musical *The Phantom of the Opera* includes a score composed by **Andrew Lloyd Webber**; the lyrics were supplied by Charles Hart and Richard Stilgoe. Lloyd Webber also collaborated with Stilgoe on the book for the production. Based on Gaston Leroux’s French novel *Le Fantôme de l’Opéra*, the show centers on the soprano Christine Daaé and the mysterious, disfigured musical genius who haunts the opera house’s underground labyrinth.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 2120737790, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "295f9823f47912abbb4331b1d03f9a7949aa27a2f48e99bec52be419642542db", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Andrew Lloyd Webber", "matched_aliases": ["Andrew Lloyd Webber"], "query_id": "test317", "question_hash": "b0d5ac074c8f34881409f78e2de015441023157f76161f6bbc9e62479a6cfc9d", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "70788777ff5607c48929f8ededd7ce0fdeeb643c41ddc0aef205fbf0276480dc", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 279360873, "similarity": 0.251900108577633, "source_content_hash": "1099f5d57babeb18d8f353cf17de94f0cca623a48e021f1c5f9b5233f61d8178", "source_hash": "4d0e3992f0c6191c364ed715eb55693026a024a8912a9544119428e72ba8fa72", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "72dd37eca6a3c52b02ce6934fe06d100630f7b4ab27686b1109824aaccaddd7c", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present":