{"doc_id": "doc30389", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Located at 301 Mission Street in San Francisco’s South of Market district, the mixed‑use development includes a 58‑story condominium tower called Millennium Tower. Rising 645 feet (197 m), it is the tallest residential building in the city. In May 2016, residents were informed that the tower was both sinking and tilting, leading to lawsuits over repair costs and disclosure.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1196420569, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "The development at 301 Mission Street in San Francisco includes a 58‑story condominium skyscraper known as Millennium Tower. Standing 645 feet (197 m) tall, it is the city’s tallest residential building and contains the majority of the project’s 419 units. In May 2016, residents were told that Millennium Tower was experiencing both settlement and a measurable tilt, prompting a series of lawsuits over repair costs and disclosure of the problem.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1888068962, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "bf2b6022fab1a3686dcc27c6e205b8985abc6895f96335586dca95275be3884b", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Millennium Tower", "matched_aliases": ["Millennium Tower"], "query_id": "test842", "question_hash": "9936e9ac4e43431598eb3a094d23547fbbeff73371f44f34badefe4d71da7dfe", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "f34c8a1e7d4b045a6280e5d8d302582b28a4bb074253f20485502c02c1639824", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1948834694, "similarity": 0.13232323232323231, "source_content_hash": "a72c52237284bbd09874d5cd65e168dc0a9ba2d31fa9cd7e43e614640f3aebd9", "source_hash": "46d5190f7c2a26181e6f3e4f6ee9d4ce9f65b06b3d759d9fb58ab884964038a3", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_ha