{"doc_id": "doc41644", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "A support van trails the Cash Cab, carrying the producers and camera crew who handle the street‑level shots. To relay logistical details and the quiz questions to the host, the crew communicates through a walkie‑talkie and earpiece worn by the host. The cab is fitted with ten cameras: one attached to the host, three focused on the passengers, one looking forward from the rear window, and three mounted in the advertising shell on the roof (front, left, and right) that capture the passing streetscape. Behind the passenger seats, the vehicle houses ten recording decks along with other production equipment.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 318467809, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "82c1be0dbbc9f5b596be7465b05ae3a1d50fd3296cb5cf6a41b8cdcb5d3a7ab0", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "walkie-talkie and earpiece", "matched_aliases": ["walkie-talkie and earpiece"], "query_id": "test1174", "question_hash": "34627fa68e9e0150f3f7da0e502a8c520a32292b4a49ad89a2d63ba6fd960b68", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "cc86333854fa25920004222791b70a7fe33ce4fd6aa9e89c610b28d25c4f3f8e", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 622515133, "similarity": 0.1474558670820353, "source_content_hash": "26e7010232fe0672c120f62bc61dcce6d35099d9a88e6e786275681d359c5c3f", "source_hash": "37bf4f67e63411f638c3f520aae90dfe48633e9ddc4fbb81f28ecfd478623838", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "44c1689a68042e06e7d0c7239937df58e3072b7cc20089a2a5e194fdb79b6e2f", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc41666", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The outbreak survived the winter of 1348‑49, yet the next winter it finally waned; by **December 1349** conditions were already beginning to return to a relative normalcy. In total, the disease required about 500 days to move across the entire country.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1925720969, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "4f26b8e8d5ec865a9e06c9ddc4b13be9a129ed921b4dc86eb3f91a2ebc003366", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "December 1349", "matched_aliases": ["December 1349"], "query_id": "test1175", "question_hash": "0d478bd52b7fa7e8e816b499f1ee0e51835d95c4a1340a33ffbd432409f7bedb", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "c9771dc3c1dd6f3463d1223b6047b80f042ce8be641f07782a663d7e8001bb6e", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 597526429, "similarity": 0.17928902627511592, "source_content_hash": "6ace9eb314cc72c57a1c16f5754a01e49422fea228e7064b5fe5d811a212252d", "source_hash": "002af12bb3236fed6ab273b4d727be3fbfa06e4e63a4920c387b6a9017b5032b", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a3e96603855b0772d30d402dd39905c676375a3ff97d89f8d2c48a4214dab1d5", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc41757", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The device entered the marketplace when entrepreneur Elijah Bond released it on July 1, 1890, marking its first commercial appearance. At that point it was treated as a simple parlor pastime rather than an occult instrument.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1835386221, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "The Ouija board made its commercial debut on July 1 1890, when entrepreneur Elijah Bond brought the device to market. Initially it was treated as a parlor game with no occult connotations, a perception that persisted until the American spiritualist Pearl Curran promoted it as a divination tool during World War I. Earlier, spiritualists had already experimented with similar talking boards at Ohio camps in 1886, claiming they could hasten communication with the dead.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 90550766, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "bfce19ae663729ac7ed51cd7b988009d1cb3a635be91125b8f21043ce793ecf1", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "July 1, 1890", "matched_aliases": ["July 1, 1890"], "query_id": "test1178", "question_hash": "b12a564966330a831e2fe624a2219923b33183e944a7cd7b0beaffda89ba8a14", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "0ffd1f40f5b180312e5dfaeb9f2845ca7f25fd223663d9311417e0294cb2a5d2", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 299382131, "similarity": 0.10607734806629834, "source_content_hash": "b0af86b65a50fc4c3cb9ddb1fb8b5da07671cb4b5e86e4e1bbec053157e226ee", "source_hash": "004f12ee650cf93ca8e7864f4be0b5d41746e08236d46169f027ef44c101a7a5", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "f5f2464b8af116a6ee7a655f1c2e78b99d3505bce2cf3d2dd0bc6c600deff147", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
