{"doc_id": "doc49590", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "As the Yuan dynasty fell apart, rival rebel groups vied for control of China and the right to found a new ruling house. In 1363, Zhu Yuanzhang crushed his chief competitor, the Han rebel leader Chen Youliang, at the Battle of Lake Poyang, employing a fleet of 200,000 Ming sailors and fire ships to defeat a force said to number 650,000. This triumph eliminated the final opposing rebel faction and left Zhu Yuanzhang in undisputed command of the fertile Yangtze River valley. After the Red Turban commander died under suspicious circumstances in 1367, no one remained capable of challenging Zhu’s advance. He sent an army toward the Yuan capital Dadu (modern Beijing) in 1368; the last Yuan emperor fled north to Shangdu, and Zhu Yuanzhang declared the founding of the Ming dynasty, razing the Yuan palaces in Dadu and renaming the city Beiping.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 2118092717, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "With the Yuan dynasty collapsing, rival rebel groups fought for control of China. In 1363, Zhu Yuanzhang defeated his chief opponent, Chen Youliang, at the Battle of Lake Poyang, securing dominance over the fertile Yangtze River valley. After the Red Turban leader died in 1367, no viable challenger remained, and in 1368 Zhu Yuanzhang advanced on the Yuan capital Dadu (modern Beijing). The last Yuan emperor fled northward, and Zhu Yuanzhang proclaimed the establishment of a new regime, the Ming dynasty, after destroying the former Yuan palaces. He adopted the era name Hongwu, meaning “Vastly Martial.”", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 2073029695, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "c4ab8727ae4708fc50ccd5dc4d8dd966fe7f9c7faad4e108ffc7190b551380d0", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Zhu Yuanzhang", "matched_aliases": ["Zhu Yuanzhang"], "query_id": "test1393", "question_hash": "897c84d404a9b4043b8a487c20935cc023e280f4dc55970b54f5cd2463618744", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "31289d8e8f3e623f60a316c42982f89da084d98df7e07f0500f3d646ecfb7c56", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 460001827, "similarity": 0.08346213292117466, "source_content_hash": "35d04cf69cee547dfbd9a6033bc25c2373ad212ab728d2d251d9e3b48434bf13", "source_hash": "3c7dbe56cbeaf79e37e8920a0448c6de56db34e4cc2f3be9ce09cf3d3cc3987b", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "072333ade730f4a431e786ba70f9f156d743d50d34923784911718d732a675db", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
