{"doc_id": "doc65714", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Founded on YouTube in 2010, FaZe Clan began by posting Call of Duty trick‑shot clips, but its content later evolved into vlogs and creative skits. The group’s YouTubers—including FaZe Banks, FaZe Apex, FaZe Blaze, FaZe Rug, FaZe Adapt, FaZe Censor and FaZe Rain—have each grown sizable audiences, though they do not compete in FaZe’s esports divisions. Every major FaZe creator now exceeds one million subscribers, with several channels ranging between three and five million. The official FaZe Clan channel holds about 4.8 million subscribers, but **FaZe Rug** has the most subscribers of all the FaZe members, with roughly 8 million followers.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 280461432, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "1cdfb63a8565935607131abfbfe2eb9d2651dcaa6a8cdcc9975525118c87e51b", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "FaZe Rug", "matched_aliases": ["FaZe Rug"], "query_id": "test1871", "question_hash": "84980ec3dd0b8656c1f93f2698d5e7cec1ec405d14db0806c4c5f2b13f66d431", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "8606395f9e52b53324465684a9293b7f7f0805e09430c57693d7158a7afc6098", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1290128690, "similarity": 0.06727037516170763, "source_content_hash": "e453d33b68a74126a71cceba4b4892d3d44f322cc464135b92f8fa7802cd8d17", "source_hash": "13d1a1b372e5509c4763ff63e299e96a4646db854e8b7af116540b38d3aad694", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "0a31669ff9dc489a68609b3a64cd95db32c496cd227f4fc2d593a7dc36e92ec7", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", 