{"doc_id": "doc77634", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 2015–16 UEFA Champions League culminated in its final on 28 May 2016 at the San Siro in Milan, Italy. The match pitted two clubs from the same Spanish city—Real Madrid and Atlético Madrid—in a repeat of the 2014 showdown. After the teams were tied 1–1 after extra time, Real Madrid won 5–3 on a penalty shoot‑out, securing a record‑extending 11th title in the competition.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1524349886, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "The championship match of the 2015‑16 UEFA Champions League was held on 28 May 2016 at Milan’s San Siro stadium, pitting the two capital‑city rivals Real Madrid against Atlético Madrid. The game finished level at 1 – 1 after extra time, and Real Madrid secured victory by winning the penalty shoot‑out 5 – 3, thereby earning their record‑extending 11th European title.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 768288289, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "fe7276ae0b38cd3fa4d5961303ed6e48fb3f700a7d612ac1465e77a4e8a9f2cf", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Real Madrid", "matched_aliases": ["Real Madrid"], "query_id": "test2233", "question_hash": "b16d557eb8dde478cc3931f3d4b167f0b77bfc345dfaf8cc7830455a932c916d", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "dd1456db29d9a4615a3519eb6304af4add1bd7cbdbcc96a1e76da2bff1133ef5", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1038242422, "similarity": 0.09481216457960644, "source_content_hash": "29166ba9af2d6af8bbb728a58a83da3de7342ad6b5277cb360a726cc25cbabce", "source_hash": "18ffc39e7ad99bc85a40db3371ce46bad31632830e8da653a5158b9fa1f43590", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "341f7cea4d4af57ebb2c979583cbdfb8dac1dcfd17d6cb97d35cdb5275d5f967", "format_attempts