{"doc_id": "doc81845", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Along Came a Spider is a 2001 American neo‑noir psychological thriller directed by Lee Tamahori and serves as the sequel to the 1997 movie Kiss the Girls. In this continuation of the series, detective Alex Cross is once more portrayed by Morgan Freeman, who reprises the role. The film’s screenplay, written by Marc Moss, adapts James Patterson’s 1993 novel of the same name, though many key plot elements from the book were omitted. Despite receiving mixed to negative reviews from critics, the movie achieved commercial success at the box office.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1702625325, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Along Came a Spider is a 2001 American neo‑noir psychological thriller directed by Lee Tamahori and serves as the sequel to the 1997 film Kiss the Girls. In this installment, Morgan Freeman reprises his role as detective Alex Cross. The screenplay, written by Marc Moss, adapts James Patterson’s 1993 novel of the same name, though many key plot elements from the book were omitted. While critics gave the film mixed to negative reviews, it performed well at the box office.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1670677894, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "c2bf4192f5d59d146681dc5b3137cee77ab3f7e1e1a447c0342b09bc6a90a001", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Morgan Freeman", "matched_aliases": ["Morgan Freeman"], "query_id": "test2366", "question_hash": "e4bee3fce1168a4abd616f1adc2d1ec60a17f31544821ffcbc7bc9964a6ad391", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "881b4abadd13b5a8a5f35d8f74653bb71a2db355ab57a3cd5eadca5c32bad075", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1561533619, "similarity": 0.31486880466472306, "source_content_hash": "e770b82e56c6f4ce3414db53137dd6bc5cc477e77ad24af2f498b31b4d7b77d6", "source_hash": "964cb6905fa7c8ce613d09373bf63602ed18e7d677234a441a0bdc77f2ac43f2", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "c48aa088aa2f9b3595600c03fcf92192d72b7d93e1512ab3faedf135fa3d063e", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc81884", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In his role as head of the Yishuv, **David Ben‑Gurion** was the first individual to affix his signature to the Israeli Declaration of Independence. Although the document was intended to be signed by all 37 members of Moetzet Ha‑Am, twelve could not be present—eleven were trapped in besieged Jerusalem and one was abroad. The 25 signatories who were on hand signed in alphabetical order, with spaces left for the absent members. Subsequent signatories, such as Zerach Warhaftig and Meir Vilner, added their names later, but the opening signature remained that of David Ben‑Gurion.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1148029547, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "84163fd6a5c4faff5dc6b3f09caf696e73b4f9c2c617877f9f1d1cf7e5eda9a8", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "David Ben-Gurion", "matched_aliases": ["David Ben-Gurion"], "query_id": "test2367", "question_hash": "008f98a6b3b35da435cb0c36a88f6f13427168b11d2c2287ae3ee78d2d3cd353", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "6face98dc73c3d076e9942227a1064bc9739d0517fb4af3e1cba03dea4c460e8", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 278926501, "similarity": 0.19806243272335844, "source_content_hash": "7da6a43107da2d58f0a46518485b7860071ed2deaf8a49bab4bef8306d388887", "source_hash": "6bd7710aeb33c5198fa4fadf1be4f6a1ddd2c89745a12b3ee30d7c6be5972837", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "7b89aeee676790401f26fdc60dc276d98f84df52a7d7b5f33d56ce016d73737d", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6