{"doc_id": "doc100213", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The series’ episodes usually open with Sam discovering his latest leap—often exclaiming “Oh, boy!”—and then follow his efforts, together with Al and Ziggy, to identify his new identity and the person he must help in order to “set right what once went wrong.” Each story typically ends on a cliff‑hanger that shows the first moments of Sam’s next jump, again punctuated by his “Oh, boy!” reaction, which is then replayed in the following episode’s opening. While early seasons treat Sam’s leaps as random, the characters eventually suspect that an unseen force is guiding them; this theme is brought to the forefront in the series’ finale episode, **“Mirror Image.”**", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1147560177, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "eaf9fb57d3948d5fe9fc177d7d926425035286a9147b8853223ea0b1ba78b443", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "\"Mirror Image\"", "matched_aliases": ["\"Mirror Image\""], "query_id": "test2928", "question_hash": "3d480533231c489ab78b4f1157f684bf4577399d2bc1e77bbf9e691845529f15", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "bbf1302c1367d30be1242c7e011bb80125ac43103a45885ec8a2925355a3e4cf", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1702499543, "similarity": 0.059930313588850176, "source_content_hash": "c7cd9928f26a5e21732f06b487ae5cd3f22f863dbecc93fb7ea5800c73b9de43", "source_hash": "b86c3f395bf1defe9fb0389627deb1c3ac40b0150e77b59f72c05aaae4c59812", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "e2e525234664c0b2dfc53dabd5942892dbd93c9668d55b57bf597257e082df32", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "v