{"doc_id": "doc31935", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the deleted scene from the episode “The Farm,” the guest cast features Majandra Delfino as Dwight’s sister Fannie, Blake Garrett Rosenthal as his nephew Cammy, Thomas Middleditch as his brother Jeb, Matt Jones as his cousin Zeke, and Tom Bower as his great‑uncle Heinrich.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 468752463, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "In the “The Farm” episode of *The Office*, the guest lineup features several members of Dwight Schrute’s extended family. Thomas Middleditch portrays Dwight’s brother Jeb, while Majandra Delfino appears as his sister Fannie, Blake Garrett Rosenthal plays his nephew Cammy, Matt Jones takes the role of his cousin Zeke, and Tom Bower shows up as his great‑uncle Heinrich in a deleted scene.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 2118333715, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "248c5823e609f597439342e0cbc46c389b1638eae1ff4568deef4318e1baa632", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Thomas Middleditch", "matched_aliases": ["Thomas Middleditch"], "query_id": "test895", "question_hash": "2f2f14a867c687a795ce95a82b03b122458d5070f8eecd6f054111f4753a6cc8", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "2964033dbea7e609901376134304b1fd5a04a4326ee032e7162753c801ce35f5", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 92071449, "similarity": 0.09331651954602774, "source_content_hash": "8e19ca6b586854505f543f6fd4a33fec60bfacc4f1a7840644a43ee403d02b7e", "source_hash": "c207a475a3576ff34bfdd8c6eba7ef7e067a9108df1091a43818a324e83326d1", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "c3df0507793d50f8ae565a3e1954a22f88f1e114ba0f4e39130dbff69824937c", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate":