{"doc_id": "doc35474", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 2017–18 NBA season, marking the league’s 72nd year, opened its regular schedule on October 17, 2017, when the Cleveland Cavaliers—who had finished as the 2017 runners‑up—hosted the Boston Celtics at Quicken Loans Arena in Cleveland, Ohio. This start date was set earlier than in prior seasons to lessen the number of “back‑to‑back” games teams would face.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 86264658, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "The 2017–18 NBA season, marking the league’s 72nd year, opened its regular schedule on October 17, 2017, when the Cleveland Cavaliers—who were the 2017 runners‑up—hosted the Boston Celtics at Quicken Loans Arena in Cleveland, Ohio.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 78566477, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "0173d35f219b315a3da4cd645c03de3b22f634f286b900608df4b36c7f89161c", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "October 17, 2017", "matched_aliases": ["October 17, 2017"], "query_id": "test1006", "question_hash": "df208159f67f8a019c0a7de8f5ced055df051b9a45a73f1543490c28a8d25b36", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "f05ba90c891827f7e768ac01f21cf92df818b71a6547de1cc1c6b03d8b479fd9", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1749720997, "similarity": 0.3410041841004184, "source_content_hash": "1d99db768ee9523dc7306fb254d1e967bb69acdbb17d2b315c613da3a5da5f4c", "source_hash": "75806b4f42313a7e540201b9713dd8cc51456910e7426236b1acefa1acc91d55", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "5d43a1a27c58a4d093da78e5052dfc02d149c00a69438e8756a269abf883f3d0", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc36511", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The 1946 American drama *The Best Years of Our Lives*—also known as *Glory for Me* and *Home Again*—was directed by William Wyler. The film, starring Myrna Loy, Fredric March, Dana Andrews, Teresa Wright, Virginia Mayo, and Harold Russell, follows three United States servicemen as they try to readjust to civilian life after World II.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1466407146, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "49ea8cf5d696f76e90388ab632ea8cff1405b28e07f37884facac901e3ab460c", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "William Wyler", "matched_aliases": ["William Wyler"], "query_id": "test1042", "question_hash": "91fa0f397067c0c6943a45e8825bf4b1a5504caee8c6799d6372a8ad407b5bfd", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "98524fe31f04dc02601eef4286938b6373471da2583fae4b9c820d3f3ed64a93", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1070398711, "similarity": 0.13861386138613863, "source_content_hash": "2cc701717ee5150e3eab2c36e37cb90e80341b652a22d0e1d7ec3f9b422648ed", "source_hash": "99eafe3c2327fc42477e15bb38a5d7a5fa41510485c086e91bf2850e73aa61d1", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "130cb6488f64cc85e034d25ad2b5a5821c25cbd937b1479dad8438315d2ba561", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc36987", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the Battlestar Galactica episode titled **“Kobol’s Last Gleaming,”** Boomer is dispatched by Commander Adama to plant a bomb on the Cylon basestar circling Kobol. While on the basestar she comes face‑to‑face with a multitude of other Number Eight copies identical to herself, and it is there that she finally confronts the reality that she is a Cylon, even though she initially refuses to accept it. After completing the mission and returning to Galactica, her concealed Cylon programming takes control, leading her to shoot Commander Adama twice and resulting in her subsequent imprisonment and interrogation.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 391189511, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Boomer’s revelation that she is a Cylon takes place in the episode titled “Kobol’s Last Gleaming.” In that installment, Commander Adama assigns her the task of destroying the basestar orbiting Kobol. While aboard the basestar she comes face‑to‑face with a multitude of other Number Eight copies that look exactly like her, and although she initially refuses to accept the truth, the concealed Cylon programming later surfaces, causing her to turn on Commander Adama and shoot him twice. The incident leads to her confinement in the brig and a harsh interrogation by Colonel Tigh, while her partner Tyrol is also detained under suspicion.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 502715343, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "45cec8db22eb206dd28d8e0063071eed676a17a1c858559cebaa97971490cd7a", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Kobol's Last Gleaming", "matched_aliases": ["Kobol's Last Gleaming"], "query_id": "test1062", "question_hash": "30d4504a5d82577dca47ab031088388b40e6887d1dc5a6a0b9e71e94d80ff420", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "4cfcb6e9176c47d91577f9d8e0905905efa53c6b63e0d57e444c5bcf21b1b7dc", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1202907120, "similarity": 0.20521172638436483, "source_content_hash": "2e15ed51bd5ade22c36fa711da4113831b52e5d5dcbb8c7d35a410a042457278", "source_hash": "2496b34ba3bd41d6f6c66e4c24a2d12acdbc7113f5f2ddd8bc89f7e4181e0b73", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "a3d962da73a5d37e581927708cb51baa29634ee5bde77e84f4a3968ab0b23517", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
