{"doc_id": "doc71665", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Linkin Park’s seventh studio album, One More Light, was issued on May 19, 2017 through Warner Bros. and Machine Shop. It became the band’s final release before lead vocalist Chester Bennington passed away on July 20, 2017.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 2113562244, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "4c1dc6a138d20b55d16158354d518b2f65eb98a00511d930504f4c3401f5c173", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "May 19, 2017", "matched_aliases": ["May 19, 2017"], "query_id": "test2058", "question_hash": "b1888d9cb6970b4e1df37566bf416377830a4d017cebbcde1a419d0e4face847", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "ce4a73dd3905853350d99059d6ee7724e26af8dcf64918e33d37a7f5a40c6864", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 931100357, "similarity": 0.6104868913857678, "source_content_hash": "9fea19a71760fb20dc746ca371c9efcf4da672f25d2a4f9e9caa2d90cc602a64", "source_hash": "900903b2b92cb424c95b1b2cd563f96c6da9ed57e59a8cee0d705c64ed382925", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "6b68e5b7e4222a2442cad72603880d9b47313fbd70d7e40c8d32ab21db14688d", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc72722", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Ted Levine’s breakout performance came in The Silence of the Lambs, where he portrayed the film’s primary antagonist—the serial killer known as Buffalo Bill.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1832899610, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Ted Levine first achieved wide recognition for his role in the thriller The Silence of the Lambs, in which he portrayed the film’s chief villain, Buffalo Bill. After that performance, he was frequently cast in antagonistic parts before later moving into more positive roles such as a police officer in Heat, astronaut Alan Shepard in the HBO miniseries From the Earth to the Moon, and Sergeant Tanner in The Fast and the Furious.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 882280442, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "04ed880a2c34e16ba0c1979b687d3220bef0468dc3666a5d2d8555ed4639dbb2", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "Buffalo Bill", "matched_aliases": ["Buffalo Bill"], "query_id": "test2092", "question_hash": "446ca000f24705300961fffc71e5b68036d8db9eaca59eb39a3100f700f87bf2", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "24a9e2590a5c85b5399c144231f0c26d80133628c38556235114ce57335c1c74", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 199945486, "similarity": 0.03954802259887006, "source_content_hash": "c3d1e63fec6575fd7d136b9edc361a7d4963e228604101bbd330db7887c03e7e", "source_hash": "16b6bc3402de9b93c431d7b11eaa74f5ee965e0a275b5561c1db81ac7e362353", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "bb683da2fcbb1412eff14a2434a5b94909b16e158195a92857fe0c22f157b967", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc80897", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the wake of Dean Skelos’s resignation from his role as Temporary President and Majority Leader in May 2015—prompted by corruption charges—the Senate’s leadership passed to a new figure. According to the account, the person now holding the position of majority leader (also referred to as president) is John J. Flanagan.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 6352078, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Following the 2010 elections, Republican Dean Skelos of Long Island held both the Temporary President and Majority Leader positions in the New York State Senate. He stepped down in May 2015 while facing corruption charges. In the wake of his resignation, the Senate’s leadership passed to John J. Flanagan, who is identified as the current Majority Leader (also serving as President) of the New York State Senate.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 183531203, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "0a8a3e488e6367f13e8d671a14aeaa90e30c417c2c8890f37b5389c1c8cfeb08", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "John J. Flanagan", "matched_aliases": ["John J. Flanagan"], "query_id": "test2343", "question_hash": "19e48219e2307cc2d40ac8ae7b931ee1ae6e6553b4af22ab0ab03c6f69a0f18e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "9f33e42f0d0d5c62227b96f2c3701ea472c23dcffbbf761f91037ea89f6e7209", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 84992860, "similarity": 0.05383153894870171, "source_content_hash": "f60fd4d98fd2f54c2e9299be0d6b665c679d00fbf551e97b09743c26a218baed", "source_hash": "646581955e79e8f4b401287084241a727e2d6ed2374fde30ecb2215242ccbdb5", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "ad9ee1e455bab296dfab7f80fe0ee5f71aef209797200edd933124880b5ff03e", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc82214", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Egyptologists hold that the Great Pyramid of Giza, built as a tomb for the Fourth Dynasty pharaoh Khufu, was constructed over a 20‑year period.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 739445057, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "5f07a56bef5f39834e32c5d4b64ec518ba9d6f593b2e7e1d024ccea38e09dae2", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "20-year period", "matched_aliases": ["20-year period"], "query_id": "test2381", "question_hash": "f9370fd4027e50c7b7dfce49f0ef716a161eb16b07fcad367a52359b27c44158", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "2735d49d258fd5bc24d3f1c4b87cd15182ece056085fd44be9dedbfaa5061f0b", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1149806763, "similarity": 0.2033626901521217, "source_content_hash": "1ae8ec78f238bd43168b0d3423739e6da2d544c61513105b80a146c7d573e528", "source_hash": "089d662f8ad513237960b4e961c73a13718f07ed926100b33779ed9e3ebfd641", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "030e27c6cddeef3325c8908153bbc5fe2ceb96fcf12d910feb766894bbed45e4", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc83792", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Dragon Ball Z made its Australian debut on the free‑to‑air commercial channel Network Ten, where it was shown in the morning children’s slot known as Cheez TV. The series first aired there in the fall of 1998, initially using the censored Funimation/Saban dub before later switching to Funimation’s in‑house dub.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 479860042, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "11bacc5f550f8b8e5fc2f891a1a14d0c1e530d411d8a397c364fc4b357a485e9", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Fall 1998", "matched_aliases": ["Fall 1998"], "query_id": "test2426", "question_hash": "5f5139d4f422e6e3646d072ff90abdacb84e6cfe46850ebbee1e402454097586", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "24cddc0875d00a9acdb4dbeba9b82cc20231732ac95035d3b3865670beb7a00a", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 945782127, "similarity": 0.21879588839941264, "source_content_hash": "ffc8043c1c6b16f1de2d47c8bb17b19f4eea5a4e9a7eed8e87c8c84b3161d427", "source_hash": "deed67a99849e18a44938b22eeb29f0264263c60f8d76be2cfa92aa0c5a02910", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "594e4e2642e537b4c9b72de5ba3e9565266eb011ca8f6f51f4b8326fc2ebdf57", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc84302", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "City & Guilds, the UK awarding organisation, maps all of its accredited qualifications onto the Regulated Qualifications Framework (RQF) as well as the Welsh and Scottish credit frameworks. The catalogue of qualifications spans **entry level to level 7** on the RQF, with the majority of courses situated between entry level and level 3. As of November 2016 the institute offered 2 312 distinct regulated qualifications, more than any other awarding body.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1443912468, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "The City and Guilds of London Institute aligns its qualifications with the Regulated Qualifications Framework (RQF) and the equivalent credit frameworks for Wales and Scotland. As of November 2016 the institute provided more than 2,300 regulated qualifications, the largest portfolio of any awarding body. These qualifications are mapped across the RQF scale, covering **entry level to level 7**, with most of them falling between entry level and level 3.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1619567342, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "47bbac3ad31c61183a02ab3ccecfdf3a0e7f10d2717618089e36b9f4b91f2633", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "entry level to level 7", "matched_aliases": ["entry level to level 7"], "query_id": "test2443", "question_hash": "fffb5aa31754e26835e405c03728d9f303d88d2b2ca1c2052e738770547e11bd", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 1, "row_hash": "5c203fa6c3bc82d6a2c26a65835875b2ed3809bbb74e3e029a3fd31bc48640c5", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1564833785, "similarity": 0.1875, "source_content_hash": "f02bca23cc7d6fcefe09cf8a494cdb4344aa760f09028379374ef88a7d073172", "source_hash": "68d95a65247a72044f0333f34ce4aca6d98d11b605d3a9474a20f8a48afbf817", "target_answer":